{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOCheckboxPicker"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MISOCheckboxPicker","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents18MISOCheckboxPickerV"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/init(selections:checkboxes:placement:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOCo